      "name": "Shared Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Default Card with source spacing and subtle foreground ring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-header\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">Review details</div><div class=\"ds-card-description\">Context for the current work.</div></div><div class=\"ds-card-content\">Evidence and supporting information.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;overflow:hidden;padding:24px 0;border-radius:var(--radius-2xl,1.125rem);background:var(--card);color:var(--card-foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px color-mix(in oklch,var(--foreground) 10%,transparent);font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-card-header{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:0 24px;}.ds-card-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;}.ds-card-description{color:var(--muted-foreground);}.ds-card-content{padding:0 24px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkbox",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "The shared compact checked state, translated to a working HTML checkbox for this preview.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-checkbox-wrap\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Keep message after a failure\"><svg class=\"ds-checkbox-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span>",
      "css": ".ds-checkbox-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-flex;width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-checkbox{appearance:none;width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:6px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:box-shadow 150ms;}.ds-checkbox:checked{border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--primary);}.ds-checkbox:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklch,var(--ring) 50%,transparent);}.ds-checkbox:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5;}.ds-checkbox-mark{position:absolute;inset:1px;width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--primary-foreground);pointer-events:none;opacity:0;}.ds-checkbox:checked+.ds-checkbox-mark{opacity:1;}:host-context(.dark) .ds-checkbox:not(:checked){background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--input) 30%,transparent);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "QA Checklist",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "qa-checklist",
      "description": "QA-only divided rows with a semantic checkbox and separate detail action; short details use the centered New task Dialog.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-checklist\"><li class=\"ds-check-row\"><span class=\"ds-checkbox-wrap\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" id=\"ds-qa-check\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><svg class=\"ds-checkbox-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span><label class=\"ds-check-label\" for=\"ds-qa-check\">Keep message after a failure</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for Keep message after a failure\"><svg class=\"ds-detail-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-checkbox-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-flex;width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-checkbox{appearance:none;width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:6px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:box-shadow 150ms;}.ds-checkbox:checked{border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--primary);}.ds-checkbox:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklch,var(--ring) 50%,transparent);}.ds-checkbox:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5;}.ds-checkbox-mark{position:absolute;inset:1px;width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--primary-foreground);pointer-events:none;opacity:0;}.ds-checkbox:checked+.ds-checkbox-mark{opacity:1;}:host-context(.dark) .ds-checkbox:not(:checked){background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--input) 30%,transparent);}.ds-checklist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-check-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;}.ds-check-row+.ds-check-row{border-top:1px solid var(--border);}.ds-check-label{flex:1;min-width:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:400;}.ds-detail{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-4xl,1.625rem);background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);transition:all 150ms;}.ds-detail-icon{width:16px;height:16px;}.ds-detail:hover{background:var(--muted);}.ds-detail:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklch,var(--ring) 50%,transparent);}.ds-detail:active{translate:0 1px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-detail:active{translate:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Restraint, layout and interaction quality",
    "overview": "Cockpit uses its existing neutral base-maia shadcn preset, local Geist fonts and lime primary accent. Familiar controls, clear hierarchy and modest density give the work priority. This records the shipped system; it does not establish a separate QA identity.\n\nThe QA workspace applies that system to selecting checks, inspecting estimates and starting runs. Its composition is scoped to QA. Bencho's restraint, layout and interaction quality are the confirmed reference; flatter grouping and fewer repeated labels keep the next action clear.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Semantic neutral surfaces in light and dark themes.",
      "Compact Geist hierarchy and pill-shaped controls.",
      "Borders, rings and tonal grouping at rest; elevation for overlays.",
      "Progressive detail and clear next actions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Pair Rule",
        "body": "Use each surface with its paired foreground and let the existing theme variables switch together.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Overlay Depth Rule",
        "body": "Preserve quiet work surfaces and use the existing floating-component treatments when content overlays the workspace.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Preset Control Rule",
        "body": "Reuse the existing shadcn variants, states and semantics; compose workflow structure around them.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use semantic surface/foreground pairs in both themes.",
      "Do preserve the preset's control radii, focus rings and disabled states.",
      "Do use tabular numerals for estimates and counts.",
      "Do keep QA's selection, estimate and Run together, and its evidence and issue fixes in the main Results view."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't override shared controls to create a separate QA visual system.",
      "Don't communicate QA outcomes through color alone."
    ]
  }
}
